    "body": "## Summary\n- add GitHub CodeQL advanced setup for Java/Kotlin backend and JavaScript/TypeScript frontend\n- use CodeQL Action v4\n- run on pull requests to master, pushes to master, and a weekly scheduled scan\n- build the Java API manually with Java 21 so compiled-code analysis follows the actual Maven project\n- analyze JavaScript/TypeScript without a build step\n- grant only contents:read and security-events:write\n\n## Why\nThe repository has strong functional/runtime CI but no semantic static security analysis yet. This closes roadmap item #55 without changing application behavior.\n\n## Validation before merge\n- both CodeQL language jobs must complete successfully on the exact PR head\n- normal CI must remain green\n- master must remain unchanged before merge\n- merge commit only, with expected head SHA",
